@page "/RERL"

<div class="docs-home">
    <h1>Rocket Engine Rendering Library (RERL)</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        The rendering backend: materials, shaders, buffers, and the core rendering pipeline.
    </p>

    <div class="home-section">
        <h2>Documentation:</h2>

        <div class="home-grid">
            <a class="home-card" href="/RERL/PrelightShaders">
                <h3>Pre‑Light Shaders</h3>
                <p>How to write shaders that run before lighting in the deferred pipeline.</p>
            </a>

            <a class="home-card" href="/RERL/PostProcess">
                <h3>Post‑Process Shaders</h3>
                <p>How to write shaders that run after the main render pass.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="home-section">
        <h2>Roadmap:</h2>
        <h5 style="margin: 0; color: var(--re-text-gray)">(Subject to change every update)</h5>

        <div class="roadmap-grid">

            <div class="roadmap-card fade-0">
                <h3>v0.3</h3>
                <p>
                    Normal maps, mesh tangent generation, shadow casting, and PBR materials.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap-card fade-1">
                <h3>v0.4</h3>
                <p>
                    Procedural post process layering pipeline, integrated AO handling, mesh normal generation, BVH Mesh/Entity/Group culling.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap-card fade-2">
                <h3>v0.5</h3>
                <p>Abstracting user GL calls to engine calls.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap-card fade-3">
                <h3>v0.6</h3>
                <p>Transparency/Glassy rendering.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap-card fade-4">
                <h3>v0.7+</h3>
                <p>Voxel GI.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>